  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Questionnaire.VARKQSO
  question: 'I want to find out more about a tour that I am going on. I would:'
  optionA: Use a map and see where the places are.
  optionB: Talk with the person who planned the tour or others who are going on the
    tour.
  optionC: Read about the tour on the itinerary.
  optionD: Look at details about the highlights and activities on the tour.
